  "description": "More Than Just Pages, It’s Your Haven. Whether you’re tracking habits, jotting down inspirations, or sketching out your dreams, this bullet journal is your perfect companion. Its high-quality pages are a joy to write on, and the durable cover means it can follow you from your reading nook to your favorite coffee shop. It’s designed to be a personalized space where you can cultivate mindfulness, organize your thoughts, and nurture your inner peace.\n*SIZE: A5\n*20 pages",
